                                                "sense_id": "c342247e-4537-3755-9ba4-9b4ca98a3579",
                                                "text": "On the stage, the beginners for the first piece had taken their places — the chorus were there, scared but determined, and in the wings waited Harlequin, in the person of Charles Lyall […]"
